  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Hello. Er, it's my migraines. The preventers, the tablets, they don't seem to be doing much.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:01",
      "end_timestamp": "00:09",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "How often are you getting migraines now?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:11",
      "end_timestamp": "00:16",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Maybe, ooh, six or seven a month? It was eight before, so not much of a change.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:18",
      "end_timestamp": "00:27",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "How long do they last, and what are they like?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:29",
      "end_timestamp": "00:35",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "One side, throbbing, with light bothering me, and I feel sick. Eight hours, sometimes a day.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:38",
      "end_timestamp": "00:47",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "When did they get worse, can you say?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:50",
      "end_timestamp": "00:55",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Um. A year ago? Or since the new job? I really couldn't say when they changed.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:57",
      "end_timestamp": "01:05",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's fine. Any aura, flashing lights, or zigzags, before them?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:07",
      "end_timestamp": "01:13",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No. None of that.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:15",
      "end_timestamp": "01:17",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "What are you taking to prevent them?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:20",
      "end_timestamp": "01:24",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "medications[2]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Propranolol, 80 mg twice a day. I think. And topiramate, 50 mg once a day, at night, but I forget it a lot. And sumatriptan, 50 mg, when I get one.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:26",
      "end_timestamp": "01:42",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "medications[2]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "So the topiramate is prescribed daily, but you often miss it. It's difficult to judge if it's working then. Any allergies?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:46",
      "end_timestamp": "01:58",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]",
        "medications[1]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, none.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:00",
      "end_timestamp": "02:02",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And your medical history?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:05",
      "end_timestamp": "02:08",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Migraines since I was a teenager, and I get anxious sometimes.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:09",
      "end_timestamp": "02:16",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Do you drink coffee, how's your sleep?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:19",
      "end_timestamp": "02:23",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Four coffees a day. And I sleep terribly, five or six hours.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:25",
      "end_timestamp": "02:31",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Pulse 62, blood pressure 112 over 70, temperature 36.6.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:56",
      "end_timestamp": "03:01",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]",
        "vital_signs[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "All fine. The propranolol slows the pulse, as expected. Any breathlessness, wheeze, or cold hands?",
      "start_timestamp": "03:09",
      "end_timestamp": "03:17",
      "supports": [
        "review_of_systems[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, nothing like that.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:20",
      "end_timestamp": "03:23",
      "supports": [
        "review_of_systems[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "So here's what I think. You've got migraines about six or seven a month, and you're missing the topiramate often, so I'd say these migraines are not well controlled, partly because the preventer isn't being taken regularly.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:25",
      "end_timestamp": "03:43",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "A lot of people are. The best step is to make the routine easier, so take it in the evening, with your teeth-cleaning, and set a phone reminder.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:53",
      "end_timestamp": "04:06",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Keep a migraine diary for a month, noting triggers, such as coffee, sleep and skipped meals.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:15",
      "end_timestamp": "04:25",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd like to see you in six weeks, to review the diary and decide whether to change the treatment.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:48",
      "end_timestamp": "05:00",
